      "time_updated": 1789887693395
    },
    {
      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To compute cosine similarity between two embedded texts, I need to use a concrete external provider. I will use the Hugging Face Transformers library, which provides pre-trained models for various NLP tasks, including sentence embeddings. The model I will use is 'sentence-transformers/all-MiniLM-L6-v2', which is a smaller version of the MiniLM model that is optimized for speed and size. </thinking>\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789887696783,
          "start": 1789887693396
        },
        "type": "text"
      },
      "id": "prt_0bd9ec254001sL0txWkEP8bhRo",
      "message_id": "msg_0bd9ebd62001THwtMwp2L08DQ6",
      "session_id": "ses_f426142acffenTT0hCHh9mC0Gp",
      "time_created": 1789887693396,
      "time_updated": 1789887696783
    },
    {
      "data": {
        "callID": "tooluse_6PzKWKdPs17h5uKLmsVkAx",
        "state": {
          "input": {
            "content": "from transformers import AutoModel, AutoTokenizer\nimport torch\n\ndef compute_similarity(text1, text2):\n    model_name = 'sentence-transformers/all-MiniLM-L6-v2'\n    model = AutoModel.from_pretrained(model_name)\n    tokenizer = AutoTokenizer.from_pretrained(model_name)\n\n    inputs1 = tokenizer(text1, return_tensors='pt', padding=True, truncation=True)\n    inputs2 = tokenizer(text2, return_tensors='pt', padding=True, truncation=True)\n\n    with torch.no_grad():\n        outputs1 = model(**inputs1)\n        outputs2 = model(**inputs2)\n\n    embedding1 = outputs1.last_hidden_state.mean(dim=1).squeeze()\n    embedding2 = outputs2.last_hidden_state.mean(dim=1).squeeze()\n\n    cosine_similarity = torch.nn.functional.cosine_similarity(embedding1, embedding2)\n    return cosine_similarity.item()\n\nif __name__ == '__main__':\n    text1 = 'This is the first sentence.'\n    text2 = 'This is the second sentence.'\n    similarity_score = compute_similarity(text1, text2)\n    print(f'Cosine similarity: {similarity_score}')\n",
            "filePath": "/private/var/folders/bf/pt_kfhl16yb4r9vfb588n1fm0000gn/T/vb-staged-me6mgl2l/similarity_score.py"
          },
